  "result": "Perfect! All 367 tests pass. Here's a summary of the renderInvoiceText enhancements:\n\n## renderInvoiceText Polish\n\n**Enhanced `src/render.js`** with richer invoice rendering:\n\n**New features added**:\n\n1. **Line-level discounts**: Each line with a discount shows the discount percentage and amount\n   - Example: `5 x Design work (hour) @ \u20ac85.00 = \u20ac425.00 (10% off: \u20ac42.50)`\n\n2. **Voucher display**: Shows before the total line with code and amount\n   - Example: `Voucher (SAVE10): -\u20ac5.00`\n\n3. **Due date**: Shows when invoice has a dueDate\n   - Example: `Due: 2023-11-14`\n\n4. **Payment amount**: Shows total paid when invoice has payments\n   - Example: `Paid: \u20ac50.00`\n\n**Rendering order**:\n```\nDRAFT/Invoice Number\nCustomer Name\nLine Items (with discounts if applicable)\nVAT (if any)\nVoucher (if any)\nTotal\nDue: [date] (if present)\nPaid: [amount] (if present)\n```\n\n**Example output** (with all features):\n```\nINV-2023-0001\nNorthwind Studio\n5 x Design work (hour) @ \u20ac85.00 = \u20ac425.00 (10% off: \u20ac42.50)\nVAT: \u20ac50.00\nVoucher (PROMO20): -\u20ac10.00\nTotal: \u20ac465.00\nDue: 2023-11-14\nPaid: \u20ac300.00\n```\n\n**Test coverage**:\n- \u2705 14 new tests added (26 total render tests)\n- \u2705 Line discount display and formatting\n- \u2705 Voucher display and positioning\n- \u2705 Due date conditional display\n- \u2705 Payment amount calculation (single and multiple payments)\n- \u2705 Integration of all features together\n- \u2705 Order verification (voucher before total, due/paid after total)\n- \u2705 Edge cases (missing dates, no payments, no vouchers)\n\n**Total test suite**: 367 tests passing",
